Today the Wise Leader announces the Day Unfailing Generosity, when every loyal citizen can get a full version of Beholder 2 for FREE (in other words – AT NO COST)! 

You are just 3 simple steps away from the gem of 2018:

go to the Ministry of Applications web-site;
submit your application till the Ministry is closed;
be among the first 1984 approved applicants.

If you meet all the requirements, you will have:

a Steam key to Beholder 2 24 hour prior to the official release; 
an unlimited access to the alpha, beta, gamma and omega versions of Beholder 2;
your name included into the list of the Citizens of Honor.

Submit your application here

https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/25109399/1e16fbc2ce6b9c712369a36c03433a11dc7dcb23.png

